{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05455","headline":"奉和勅赐公主镜 · 席豫","name":"奉和勅赐公主镜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"令节颁龙镜，仙辉下凤台。\n含灵万象入，写照百花开。\n色与皇明散，光随圣泽来。\n妍媸冰监里，从此愧非才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"席豫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}